      "start_seconds": 187.35,
      "end_seconds": 197.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 81 beats a minute, blood pressure 116 over 75, temperature is 36.8 degrees, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
