      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.07,
      "end_seconds": 282.94,
      "duration_seconds": 19.87,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with osteoporosis with a fragility fracture do well once it's treated properly. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a back that has got shorter, and no weight loss or numbness."
    },
